msgid "The MRCC program of M. Kallay (MRCC)"
msgstr "M. Kallay 的 MRCC 程序 (MRCC)"

msgid "Installing MRCC"
msgstr "安装 MRCC"

msgid ""
"Please refer to the MRCC documentation on how to install the MRCC program. "
"The MRCC executables must be found in PATH in order for Molpro to use them."
msgstr "请参阅 MRCC 文档了解如何安装 MRCC 程序。MRCC 可执行文件必须位于 PATH 环境变量中，以便 Molpro 使用它们。"

msgid "Running MRCC"
msgstr "运行MRCC"

msgid "The ``MRCC`` program is invoked by the command"
msgstr "``MRCC``\\ 程序通过以下命令调用"

msgid ""
"The available options summarized in `#options for MRCC "
"<the_mrcc_program_of_m._kallay_mrcc.html#options-for-mrcc>`__. For a "
"detailed description please refer to the MRCC manual of M. Kallay (file "
"”manual” the mrcc directory)."
msgstr ""
"可用选项总结于 `#options for MRCC <.html#options-for-mrcc>`__\\ 。详细描述请参阅 M. Kallay "
"的 MRCC 手册（位于 mrcc 目录中的文件“manual”）"

msgid ""
"In Molpro the method to be used can be given as a string (option "
"``METHOD``\\ =\\ *string*). The available methods and the corresponding "
"``MRCC`` input parameters (see MRCC manual) as specified in `#methods "
"available in the MRCC program "
"<the_mrcc_program_of_m._kallay_mrcc.html#methods-available-in-the-mrcc-"
"program>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 中，要使用的方法可以指定为一个字符串（选项 ``METHOD``\\ =\\ *string*\\ ）。可用方法及对应的 "
"``MRCC`` 输入参数（参见 MRCC 手册）如 `#methods available in the MRCC program "
"<.html#methods-available-in-the-mrcc-program>`__ 中所指定。"

msgid ""
"Directives are usually not necessary, but the ``CORE``, ``OCC``, "
"``ORBITAL``, ``MAXIT``, directives work as in the Molpro CCSD program. In "
"addition, the number of states can be given on a ``STATE`` directive and "
"this has the same meaning as the ``EOM_NSTATES`` option."
msgstr ""
"通常不需要指令，但 ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``ORBITAL``\\ 、\\ ``MAXIT`` 指令的工作方式与 "
"Molpro CCSD 程序中的相同。此外，状态数可以在 ``STATE`` 指令上指定，其含义与 ``EOM_NSTATES`` 选项相同。"

